# Refactoring & Optimization Changelog

When something breaks or behaves unexpectedly, check this log first to see if a recent refactoring commit may have caused it.

## Commit Log

### 1. Dead Code Removal (June 14, 2026)

**What changed:**
- Deleted `src/lib/frroBookmarklet.ts` (entire file) — was never imported; FRRO bookmarklet logic is inlined in `AdminRecords.tsx`
- Removed npm deps: `@anthropic-ai/sdk`, `html-to-image`, `pdf-parse` — none were imported in `src/`
- Removed `extractFormCData()` + `FormCExtractedData` type from `src/lib/parsePassportData.ts`
- Removed `generateDailySummary()` + `DailySummaryData` type from `src/components/admin/FoodBillGenerator.tsx`
- Removed `BED_HEADERS` constant from `src/components/admin/types.ts`
- Removed `PastEventCard` export alias from `src/components/sections/CardWithModal.tsx`
- Deleted stale `drizzle/migrations/` directory (production uses `migrations/` via Wrangler)
- Deleted 3 unreferenced food images: `gulab-jamun.jpg`, `rasmalai.jpg`, `palak-paneer.jpg`

**What could break:**
- If any external script or tool imported `frroBookmarklet.ts` directly (none found in repo)
